From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 02:57:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 20/24] configs: mediatek_mobile: enable the clock framework

Without CONFIG_CLK every clk_get() returns -ENOSYS: on the T880 the UFS
PHY ("Failed to get clocks (ret=-38)") and mtu3 ("failed to get clocks
-38") failed to probe although their DT clocks are fixed-clock nodes,
which the generic fixed-rate driver provides.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 configs/mediatek_mobile_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/configs/mediatek_mobile_defconfig b/configs/mediatek_mobile_defconfig
index 055937133e2..7840d3e68d8 100644
--- a/configs/mediatek_mobile_defconfig
+++ b/configs/mediatek_mobile_defconfig
@@ -63,6 +63,7 @@ CONFIG_FASTBOOT_BUF_ADDR=0x0
 CONFIG_FASTBOOT_BUF_SIZE=0x8000000
 # CONFIG_FASTBOOT_FLASH is not set
 CONFIG_FASTBOOT_CMD_OEM_CONSOLE=y
+CONFIG_CLK=y
 CONFIG_PHY=y
 CONFIG_PHY_MTK_XSPHY=y
 CONFIG_PINCTRL=y
-- 
2.55.0

